DESCRIPTION:Student research at Duke doesn't slow down over the summer! On
  July 24\, students from summer programs across Duke will gather to share
  their research in natural sciences\, health policy\, medicine\, engineer
 ing\, and more. You're invited to stop by Bostock Library from 10 am - 12
  pm to show your support and get a sense of the vast research being done 
 on campus this summer! All are welcome to attend. Light breakfast and bev
 erage options will be provided.
DURATION:PT2H
