 ets: $18\, or $30 for both\nTickets are purchased through Duke University
 's Box Office. Duke employee and student discounts do not apply.\nRecomme
 nded for ages 3+\n\nCompany Website: pilobolus.org\n\nThe Children's Satu
 rday Matinee series presents one-hour performances specially curated to i
 gnite and inspire children's imaginations. A free Kids Party follows each
  matinee in the Bryan Center lobby\, complete with snacks\, fun activitie
 s\, and a meet-and-greet with company dancers. \n\nChildren's Matinee Ser
 ies\nSaturday\, July 4 at 12 pm: Mark Morris Dance Group\nSaturday\, July
  25 at 12 pm: Pilobolus\n\nPhoto Credit: Mahaiwe
