 ges from 9:45 - 10:45 a.m. in the lowest level of the Divinity School Bui
 ldings. New participants are welcome to attend at any time.\n\nWEE PRAISE
 : Infants and toddlers\, ages 0-3\, along with parent(s) or caregiver(s) 
 gather in 0011 Westbrook.\n\nGODLY PLAY: Children in preschool-5th grade 
 meet in 0054 Langford.\n\nYOUTH PROGRAM: The Youth Sunday School group (g
 rades 6-12) will meet in Westbrook 0012.
